# Some editors / latexmk drop these:
_minted*/
*.pyg
*.figlist
*.makefile
*.fls

# The compiled book PDF: ignore by default. If you DO want to commit the final
# PDF as a deliverable, remove the next line or force-add it deliberately.
# billiard_ball_universe.pdf
# AI-generated illustration masters live in art/ and ARE committed (they are
# sources, not build artifacts) -- do not add art/ here.
#
# One exception: art/cover/ is the SUPERSEDED cover working directory from before the
# REPO-2 restructure, not a master. The live cover is cover/, and art/cover/'s copies are
# stale -- its cover_wrap.tex still carries the retired "local ratio", its
# cover_art_build.tex predates both the SPDX headers and the zoomcone refactor (4d7f7be),
# and its PROVENANCE.md lacks the regeneration section. Committing it would duplicate the
# cover and write the retired phrase into public history. Kept on disk (and on the
# external mirror) as generation history -- candidate rounds, contact sheets, the
# gen_candidates scripts -- which its own nested .gitignore was already curating.
art/cover/

# ---- Environment / secrets ----
# If any tooling talks to an LLM endpoint, keys live here — never commit them.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local

# ---- Editors / IDEs ----
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.iml
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ---- OS cruft ----
# Windows
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
# macOS (in case the repo travels)
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
# Linux
.directory

# ---- Logs / temp / scratch ----
logs/
tmp/
temp/
/scratch/

# ---- Editor backups ----
*.bak

# ---- Python tooling (only if we add helper scripts) ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ---- Claude Code (local session/config; keep CLAUDE.md tracked) ----
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/commands/
# settings.local.json is per-developer local permissions — never committed.
.claude/settings.local.json
# NOTE: CLAUDE.md is intentionally NOT ignored — it is committed.

# ---- Drop-zone ----
# nbj/ is Niels's private drop-zone for chat-claude outputs (duplicates, handoffs, scratch).
# Never public: authoritative patches/reports are curated into record/ instead.
nbj/

# Beta reader draft (emailed deliverable, regenerable) — not versioned
bbu_reader_draft*.pdf

# Built book PDF — not committed except tagged releases (see process/PDF_POLICY.md)
manuscript/billiard_ball_universe.pdf
